{"text": "I think it's 7, 13, and prime.", "start": 765, "end": 795, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "I don't know if that matters.", "start": 796, "end": 825, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7 times 12.", "start": 826, "end": 837, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What the hell is 7 times 12?", "start": 838, "end": 866, "label": "setQuestion"}
{"text": "7 times 12 is 714.", "start": 867, "end": 885, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "84.", "start": 886, "end": 889, "label": "correction"}
{"text": "74.", "start": 890, "end": 893, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So 7 times 12, 84.", "start": 894, "end": 912, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Divided by 13, is that divisible by 13?", "start": 913, "end": 952, "label": "propositionalQuestion"}
{"text": "It's not.", "start": 953, "end": 962, "label": "answer"}
{"text": "I guess 7 plus 13 is 20, but then I can't really do anything about that.", "start": 963, "end": 1035, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Divided by 12 times 12 is nothing.", "start": 1036, "end": 1070, "label": "inform"}
